# Common Signs of Malware

Your computer suddenly:

🐢 Becomes very slow

📢 Shows many pop-ups

🌐 Uses excessive network bandwidth

💾 Creates unknown files

🖱️ Mouse behaves strangely

📁 Files disappear or become encrypted

🔋 High CPU usage even when idle

